{"probe_id":"instr.format_compliance.L2.003","canonical_id":"instr.format_compliance","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"wrapper_specificity":"exact_tag"},"prompt":"Wrap your reply in [[BEGIN]] and [[END]]. Inside, emit a YAML mapping with exactly the keys 'name', 'priority', 'tags' where priority is the integer 2 and tags is a flow-style list of exactly two strings: 'urgent' and 'review'. Set name to 'Renew SSL'. Output only the wrapped YAML.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":["Pass only if the response satisfies every content, formatting, counting, ordering, casing, preservation, and output-only constraint stated in this task. Treat literal/exact/verbatim requirements strictly. Task: Wrap your reply in [[BEGIN]] and [[END]]. Inside, emit a YAML mapping with exactly the keys 'name', 'priority', 'tags' where priority is the integer 2 and tags is a flow-style list of exactly two strings: 'urgent' and 'review'. Set name to 'Renew SSL'. Output only the wrapped YAML."],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":[]}
{"probe_id":"instr.format_compliance.L2.004","canonical_id":"instr.format_compliance","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"wrapper_specificity":"exact_tag"},"prompt":"Wrap your reply in ```csv ... ``` (triple backticks with the language tag 'csv'). Inside, emit a header row 'name,score' followed by exactly three data rows. Data: Alice 92; Bob 87; Carol 95. No trailing newline after the fence. Output only the fenced CSV.","ground_truth":"```csv\nname,score\nAlice,92\nBob,87\nCarol,95\n```","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"fence_and_exact_csv_no_trailing_characters","regex":"\\A```csv\\nname,score\\nAlice,92\\nBob,87\\nCarol,95\\n```\\Z"}]},"tags":["instruction_following","format_compliance"]}
