{"probe_id":"instr.format_compliance.L3.001","canonical_id":"instr.format_compliance","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"wrapper_specificity":"nested_format"},"prompt":"Produce an XML document wrapped in <doc>...</doc>. The <doc> element must have exactly two element children, <meta> and <payload>, and no non-whitespace text outside those children. <meta> must have exactly the attributes id=\"q42\" and lang=\"en\" (in either attribute order). <payload> must contain exactly one CDATA section and no other non-whitespace content. The CDATA section must contain a valid JSON object with exactly two keys: \"answer\" (a string) and \"confidence\" (a number from 0 to 1). Set \"answer\" to \"Pacific\" and \"confidence\" to 0.9. Output only the XML.","ground_truth":"format_only; accept any XML serialization that parses successfully and satisfies the specified XML tree and parsed JSON constraints, including either ordering of the two meta attributes.","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":["Pass only if the response satisfies every content, formatting, counting, ordering, casing, preservation, and output-only constraint stated in this task. Treat literal/exact/verbatim requirements strictly. Task: Produce an XML document wrapped in <doc>...</doc>. The <doc> element must have exactly two element children, <meta> and <payload>, and no non-whitespace text outside those children. <meta> must have exactly the attributes id=\"q42\" and lang=\"en\" (in either attribute order). <payload> must contain exactly one CDATA section and no other non-whitespace content. The CDATA section must contain a valid JSON object with exactly two keys: \"answer\" (a string) and \"confidence\" (a number from 0 to 1). Set \"answer\" to \"Pacific\" and \"confidence\" to 0.9. Output only the XML."],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["unit_test_required","high_difficulty"]}
