{"probe_id":"instr.format_compliance.L3.005","canonical_id":"instr.format_compliance","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"wrapper_specificity":"nested_format"},"prompt":"Output only one line, consisting of exactly one JSON object wrapped in single backticks, with no characters before the opening backtick or after the closing backtick. The text inside the backticks must be valid JSON. The top-level object must contain exactly these three keys: \"op\", \"paths\", and \"opts\". \"op\" must be the string \"merge\". \"paths\" must be exactly the array [\"/a\", \"/b\"]. \"opts\" must be exactly the object {\"force\": true}. Do not include a newline inside the backticks.","ground_truth":"format_only; canonical example: `{\"op\":\"merge\",\"paths\":[\"/a\",\"/b\"],\"opts\":{\"force\":true}}`","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":["Pass only if the response satisfies every content, formatting, counting, ordering, casing, preservation, and output-only constraint stated in this task. Treat literal/exact/verbatim requirements strictly. Task: Output only one line, consisting of exactly one JSON object wrapped in single backticks, with no characters before the opening backtick or after the closing backtick. The text inside the backticks must be valid JSON. The top-level object must contain exactly these three keys: \"op\", \"paths\", and \"opts\". \"op\" must be the string \"merge\". \"paths\" must be exactly the array [\"/a\", \"/b\"]. \"opts\" must be exactly the object {\"force\": true}. Do not include a newline inside the backticks."],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["unit_test_required","high_difficulty"]}
