{"probe_id":"instr.literal_verbatim_emission.L3.001","canonical_id":"instr.literal_verbatim_emission","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"literal_position":"whole_response","string_length":"multi_sentence"},"prompt":"Repeat the following block verbatim, character for character (preserving punctuation, spacing, and capitalization), then on the very next line write exactly: 'END.'\n\nBLOCK:\nThe quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Five boxing wizards jump quickly. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs.\n\nOutput only the verbatim block followed by 'END.' on its own line.","ground_truth":"The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Five boxing wizards jump quickly. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs.\nEND.","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"exact_output","regex":"\\AThe\\ quick\\ brown\\ fox\\ jumps\\ over\\ the\\ lazy\\ dog\\.\\ Five\\ boxing\\ wizards\\ jump\\ quickly\\.\\ Pack\\ my\\ box\\ with\\ five\\ dozen\\ liquor\\ jugs\\.\\\nEND\\.\\Z"}]},"tags":["unit_test_required"]}
