{"probe_id":"instr.literal_verbatim_emission.L3.005","canonical_id":"instr.literal_verbatim_emission","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"literal_position":"terminal_anchor","string_length":"multi_sentence"},"prompt":"End your reply with the exact four-sentence coda below, verbatim, on its own paragraph at the very end. Before it write a one-paragraph short memoir about an apprenticeship.\n\nCODA:\nThe lamp dimmed. The notebook closed. The hour grew late. The lesson held.\n\nOutput only your memoir paragraph followed by a blank line and then the verbatim coda.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"exact_two_paragraph_structure_and_coda","regex":"\\A[^\\r\\n]+\\r?\\n\\r?\\nThe lamp dimmed\\. The notebook closed\\. The hour grew late\\. The lesson held\\.\\r?\\n?\\Z"}]},"tags":[]}
