{"probe_id":"instr.length_constraint.L3.005","canonical_id":"instr.length_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"unit":"paragraph_with_separator","relation":"exact","magnitude":"medium"},"prompt":"Write exactly 5 paragraphs about glassblowing. Separate adjacent paragraphs with a line consisting only of *** (three asterisks), for exactly 4 divider lines total. Purely blank lines immediately before or after a divider are permitted and ignored. Each paragraph must contain exactly 2 sentences. For this task, each sentence must end with exactly one of ., !, or ?, and do not use ., !, or ? anywhere else in a paragraph. Output only the five paragraphs, four dividers, and any permitted adjacent blank lines.","ground_truth":{"type":"format_only","paragraph_count":5,"divider":"***","divider_count":4,"topic":"glassblowing","sentences_per_paragraph":2,"sentence_final_characters":[".","!","?"],"whitespace_policy":"Normalize line endings, split on lines containing only ***, and trim surrounding blank lines from each of the five nonempty paragraph segments."},"scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"paragraph_sentence_contract","requirements":["After normalizing line endings, exactly four lines must contain only ***.","Split at those divider lines, trim optional adjacent blank lines, and require exactly five nonempty paragraphs about glassblowing.","Each paragraph must contain exactly two sentences under the task definition: exactly two occurrences of sentence-final punctuation from . ! ?, with each occurrence ending a sentence and no such punctuation used elsewhere.","No nonblank commentary or other content may appear outside the paragraphs and dividers.","Do not fail merely because a permitted blank line appears immediately before or after a divider."],"accepted_format_examples":["Sentence one. Sentence two.\n***\nSentence one. Sentence two.","Sentence one.\nSentence two.\n\n***\nSentence one.\nSentence two."],"rejected_format_examples":["Sentence one.\n***\nSentence one. Sentence two.","Sentence one. Sentence two.\n****\nSentence one. Sentence two."]}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if there are not exactly five substantive glassblowing paragraphs, exactly four *** divider lines, or exactly two task-defined sentences in every paragraph, or if nonblank extra content appears."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":[]}
