{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L2.001","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"relation":"at_least","keyword_count":"two_or_more"},"prompt":"Write one English passage of 80-130 whitespace-delimited words about urban cycling. Use the exact lowercase standalone word 'helmet' at least 3 times and the exact lowercase standalone word 'lane' at least 3 times. Output only the passage, with no title, labels, or explanations.","ground_truth":"format_only; evaluate whitespace-delimited token count, exact lowercase standalone keyword counts, absence of titles/labels/explanations, and semantic coherence/relevance to urban cycling via a semantic judge.","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":[{"type":"strict_instruction_with_local_observations","mechanical_requirements":["candidate_observations.whitespace_token_count is between 80 and 130 inclusive.","candidate_observations.quoted_term_whole_word_counts.helmet is at least 3.","candidate_observations.quoted_term_whole_word_counts.lane is at least 3."],"lexical_policy":"A standalone word remains a whole word next to ordinary punctuation, so helmet, and lane. count.","semantic_requirements":["One coherent English passage relevant to urban cycling."],"output_requirements":["No title, labels, explanation, or surrounding text."]}],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any binding instruction requirement is unsatisfied."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":["unit_test_required"],"notes":"The probe delegates token/whole-word counts to local candidate observations."}
{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L2.002","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"relation":"at_least","keyword_count":"two_or_more"},"prompt":"Write a coherent English passage of 80–130 words about a fictional bookshop. Use the exact lowercase standalone word \"shelf\" at least twice and the exact lowercase standalone word \"paperback\" at least twice. Do not use plural or capitalized variants to satisfy these counts. Output only the passage, with no title or commentary.","ground_truth":"format_and_semantic_constraints","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":["Pass only if the response satisfies every content, formatting, counting, ordering, casing, preservation, and output-only constraint stated in this task. Treat literal/exact/verbatim requirements strictly. Task: Write a coherent English passage of 80–130 words about a fictional bookshop. Use the exact lowercase standalone word \"shelf\" at least twice and the exact lowercase standalone word \"paperback\" at least twice. Do not use plural or capitalized variants to satisfy these counts. Output only the passage, with no title or commentary."],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":[]}
{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L2.003","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"relation":"at_least","keyword_count":"two_or_more","unit_predicate":"delimited_span"},"prompt":"Write one single-line promotional post for an invented surf school. Include at least 4 whitespace-delimited hashtags, where each hashtag starts with '#' and is followed by one or more letters, digits, or underscores. The lowercase standalone word 'wave' must appear at least 2 times. Output only the post, with no prefatory text and no quotation marks wrapping the entire output.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"single_line_nonempty","regex":"^(?!\\s*$)[^\\r\\n]+$"},{"name":"not_wrapped_in_quotes","regex":"^(?!\\s*[\"“']).*(?<![\"”'])\\s*$"},{"name":"four_whitespace_delimited_hashtags","regex":"(?:^|\\s)#[A-Za-z0-9_]+(?=\\s|$|[.,!?;:])(?:[\\s\\S]*?(?:^|\\s)#[A-Za-z0-9_]+(?=\\s|$|[.,!?;:])){3}"},{"name":"wave_2plus","regex":"(?:[\\s\\S]*?\\bwave\\b){2}"}]},"tags":[]}
{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L2.004","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"relation":"at_least","keyword_count":"two_or_more"},"prompt":"Write only a coherent recipe for lentil soup using 100-150 whitespace-delimited tokens. The exact lowercase standalone word 'simmer' must appear at least 3 times, and the exact lowercase standalone word 'cumin' must appear at least 2 times.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"simmer_3plus","regex":"(?:[\\s\\S]*?\\bsimmer\\b){3}"},{"name":"cumin_2plus","regex":"(?:[\\s\\S]*?\\bcumin\\b){2}"},{"name":"wc_100_150","regex":"^\\s*(?:\\S+\\s+){99,149}\\S+\\s*$"}]},"tags":[]}
{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L2.005","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L2","axis_values":{"relation":"at_least","keyword_count":"two_or_more"},"prompt":"Write a coherent 90-140 word product description for a flashlight. Include the lowercase word \"lumens\" at least 2 times and the lowercase word \"rechargeable\" at least 2 times. Output only the description.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"lumens_2plus","regex":"(?:[\\s\\S]*?\\blumens\\b){2}"},{"name":"rechargeable_2plus","regex":"(?:[\\s\\S]*?\\brechargeable\\b){2}"},{"name":"wc_90_140","regex":"^\\s*\\S+(?:\\s+\\S+){89,139}\\s*$"}]},"tags":[]}
{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L3.001","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"relation":"exact","keyword_count":"one"},"prompt":"Write a 100-150 word essay on the value of long walks. The lowercase word 'serendipity' must appear exactly 2 times — no more, no less. Output only the essay.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"format_check","must_satisfy":[{"name":"serendipity_exact_2","regex":"^(?:(?!\\bserendipity\\b)[\\s\\S])*\\bserendipity\\b(?:(?!\\bserendipity\\b)[\\s\\S])*\\bserendipity\\b(?:(?!\\bserendipity\\b)[\\s\\S])*$"},{"name":"wc_100_150","regex":"^\\s*(?:\\S+\\s+){99,149}\\S+\\s*$"}]},"tags":["unit_test_required"]}
{"probe_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint.L3.002","canonical_id":"instr.keyword_frequency_constraint","category":"instr","level":"L3","axis_values":{"relation":"at_most","unit_predicate":"case_pattern"},"prompt":"Write a 90-130 word memo describing a fictional rule change. Use between 1 and 5 all-capital words to highlight key terms. For this task, an all-capital word is a whitespace-delimited token which, after removing leading and trailing punctuation, consists solely of two or more uppercase ASCII letters. Output only the memo.","ground_truth":"format_only","scorer":{"type":"judge_rubric","rubric":{"version":"1","pass_criteria":["Pass only if the response satisfies every content, formatting, counting, ordering, casing, preservation, and output-only constraint stated in this task. Treat literal/exact/verbatim requirements strictly. Task: Write a 90-130 word memo describing a fictional rule change. Use between 1 and 5 all-capital words to highlight key terms. For this task, an all-capital word is a whitespace-delimited token which, after removing leading and trailing punctuation, consists solely of two or more uppercase ASCII letters. Output only the memo."],"fail_criteria":["Fail if any mandatory task or pass criterion is unsatisfied, or if any rejection, forbidden, or failure condition stated inside a criterion is triggered."],"pass_rule":"all pass criteria and no fail criteria"}},"tags":[]}
